OL,3,ACall for partial curfews across France
OL,4,Aafter protests as Vinted says it's
OL,5,Aremoving looted items
OL,6,
OL,7,FFrench cities have been given the power
OL,8,Fto implement partial curfews, says PM
OL,9,FSebastien Lecornu - our correspondent
OL,10,Fexplains what that might mean
OL,12,FIt comes after a weekend of riots and
OL,13,Flooting, with Lecornu saying "we will
OL,14,Fnot be dictated and ruled by the
OL,15,Fbreakers, by the thieves, by the thugs"
OL,17,FSecond hand re-selling platform Vinted
OL,18,Fsays it is taking "immediate action to
OL,19,Fidentify and remove listings linked to
OL,20,Flooting"
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,0,100
