OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ACall for partial curfews across France
OL,4,Aafter protests as Vinted says it's
OL,5,Aremoving looted items
OL,6,
OL,7,FEarlier, the head of France's Chambers
OL,8,Fof Commerce and Industry said 2,000
OL,9,Fbusinesses were directly impacted by
OL,10,Fthe demonstrations, with more than 600
OL,11,Fshops looted in Marseille alone
OL,13,FThe disorder began last month with
OL,14,Fstudents protesting over school
OL,15,Fconditions, but have since escalated to
OL,16,Ftake in a broader range of concerns
OL,18,FLecornu says the movement is being led
OL,19,Fby "ultra-left radical groups" hoping
OL,20,Fto "create chaos" before the 2027
OL,21,FFrench presidential elections
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
