OL,3,ACall for partial curfews across France
OL,4,Aafter protests as Vinted says it's
OL,5,Aremoving looted items
OL,6,
OL,7,FMore than half a million people took to
OL,8,Fthe streets on Saturday. On Sunday,
OL,9,Fmore than 350 arrests were made in
OL,10,FParis alone, with at least five shops
OL,11,Flooted
